WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.950
Movie Night turns your room into a screening. Share a screen, and everybody watches along, live.

2
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:16.598
Press share, then choose a browser tab, a window, or your whole screen. If there's sound, tick the box to share it so everyone can hear.

3
00:00:16.748 --> 00:00:21.301
You can pick the quality too, from smooth movies to sharp text for slides.

4
00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:29.948
Use the microphone and camera buttons to chat while you watch. Tap a face to make it bigger. And headphones help to avoid echo.

5
00:00:30.098 --> 00:00:34.329
Throw emoji reactions on screen whenever something deserves one.

6
00:00:35.029 --> 00:00:43.518
Anyone can present when nobody else is, and the host can stop a share. Phones can watch and chat, but they can't share a screen.
